  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Grab - Make A Fist With Your Hands over or near the object.\r\n\r\nGrabable
    Items \r\n\r\n\t- Lighter \r\n\t- Door \r\n\t- Papers \r\n\r\nThe Blue Ghosts
    disappear when you look at them.\r\n\r\nThe White Ghost will also disappear at
    the window. Don't look at her, or you'll lose your connection.\r\n\r\nRed Ghosts
    disappear when you shut the door on them.\r\n\r\nThe White ghost will also disappear
    from the shut door, don't close it on her or keep it shut, or you'll loose ur
    connection. \r\n\r\nThe goal of the game is to KEEP your CONNECTION STRONG TILL
    8 AM to contact your sister one last time.\r\n"
